---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="TrafficChallan has no accounts and collects no personal data. The fine calculator runs entirely in your browser."
  path="/privacy/"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy', path: '/privacy/' }]}
>
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>

  <p>
    TrafficChallan has no user accounts, no sign-up, and no login. We do not ask for your name, phone
    number, email address, or any other personal detail to use the site, and we don't collect any of that
    ourselves.
  </p>

  <h2>The fine calculator</h2>
  <p>
    Our <a href="/calculator/">fine calculator</a> doesn't ask for a vehicle registration number or any
    personal detail — you only pick an offence and a state from a couple of dropdowns and, optionally, a
    repeat-offence checkbox. The offence and fine data for
    every state is loaded onto the page when it renders, and the calculation itself runs entirely in your
    browser's JavaScript. Nothing you select in the calculator is sent to our servers or to anyone else;
    there's no server-side lookup involved at all.
  </p>

  <h2>Official portals</h2>
  <p>
    TrafficChallan links to official government portals for actually checking or paying a challan — for
    example echallan.parivahan.gov.in or your state's traffic police site. Those are independent
    government systems with their own privacy practices, and this policy doesn't cover them. Once you
    click through to a government portal, whatever data-handling rules that portal has apply, not ours.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    We may enable Cloudflare Web Analytics on this site. It is cookieless and privacy-respecting by
    design — it doesn't use tracking cookies or fingerprinting, and it doesn't collect any information
    that identifies you personally. If we turn it on, it's only ever used to see aggregate things like
    which pages get traffic, not to track individual visitors.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    This site does not currently run advertising. If we introduce advertising in the future, it may
    involve third-party ad networks that use cookies or similar technology, and we will update this
    policy to describe exactly what's involved before that happens — not after.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>
    If you have any question about privacy on this site, email
    <a href="mailto:contact@trafficchallan.com">contact@trafficchallan.com</a> and we'll answer directly.
  </p>
</Base>
